tem c184ec8e81027f31__block components-flex-item components-flex-block components-toggle-control__label" style="--wp-components-flex-item-display: block;">Enhanced hover effect (cursor glow)</label></div></div></div><p class="components-base-control__help">A soft glow in the Hover text color above that follows the cursor, same size as the button glow effect. Set a Hover text color above for this to be visible — while this is on, that color only drives the glow and no longer recolors the whole text on hover.</p></div>",
