ection: row; --wp-components-flex-wrap: nowrap; --wp-components-flex-gap: 0; --wp-components-flex-justify: start;"><span class="components-checkbox-control__input-container"><input id="inspector-checkbox-control-265" class="components-checkbox-control__input" type="checkbox" value="1"></span><label class="components-checkbox-control__label" for="inspector-checkbox-control-265">Bounce</label></div></div></div><div class="_94dff8a2f7c49fc8__wrapper components-base-control components-toggle-control"><div class="d9ac8e2c0db95cc7__field components-base-control__field"><div data-wp-c16t="true" data-wp-component="HStack" class="e518617e7c3a18e7__flex _3896336788892095__items-row cc39999a5fb580d4__expanded-row components-flex components-h-stack" style="--wp-components-flex-align: center; --wp-components-flex-direction: row; --wp-components-flex-wrap: nowrap; --wp-components-flex-gap: calc(4px * 2); --wp-components-flex-justify: flex-start;"><span class="components-form-toggle"><input class="components-form-toggle__input" id="inspector-toggle-control-95" type="checkbox"><span class="components-form-toggle__track"></span><span class="components-form-toggle__thumb"></span></span><label data-wp-c16t="true" data-wp-component="FlexBlock" for="inspector-toggle-control-95" class="bc09d0edcc10c304__item c184ec8e81027f31__block components-flex-item components-flex-block components-toggle-control__label" style="--wp-components-flex-item-display: block;">Fade opacity on hover</label></div></div></div><p class="components-base-control__help">Drag the color's alpha slider for a translucent hover background — e.g. white at 20% opacity.</p><p class="components-base-control__help">Set a border width and style in this block's own Border panel first — this only changes the border's color on hover.</p><div class="_94dff8a2f7c49fc8__wrapper components-base-control components-toggle-control"><div class="d9ac8e2c0db95cc7__field components-base-control__field"><div data-wp-c16t="true" data-wp-component="HStack" class="e518617e7c3a18e7__flex _3896336788892095__items-row cc39999a5fb580d4__expanded-row components-flex components-h-stack" style="--wp-components-flex-align: center; --wp-components-flex-direction: row; --wp-components-flex-wrap: nowrap; --wp-components-flex-gap: calc(4px * 2); --wp-components-flex-justify: flex-start;"><span class="components-form-toggle is-checked"><input class="components-form-toggle__input" id="inspector-toggle-control-96" type="checkbox" checked=""><span class="components-form-toggle__track"></span><span class="components-form-toggle__thumb"></span></span><label data-wp-c16t="true" data-wp-component="FlexBlock" for="inspector-toggle-control-96" class="bc09d0edcc10c304__item c184ec8e81027f31__block components-flex-item components-flex-block components-toggle-control__label" style="--wp-components-flex-item-display: block;">Activate when centred on touch screens</label></div></div></div><p class="components-base-control__help">On touch screens there is no hover, so the hover effect plays while this block is the one nearest the centre of the screen.</p><div class="_94dff8a2f7c49fc8__wrapper components-base-control components-toggle-control"><div class="d9ac8e2c0db95cc7__field components-base-control__field"><div data-wp-c16t="true" data-wp-component="HStack" class="e518617e7c3a18e7__flex _3896336788892095__items-row cc39999a5fb580d4__expanded-row components-flex components-h-stack" style="--wp-components-flex-align: center; --wp-components-flex-direction: row; --wp-components-flex-wrap: nowrap; --wp-components-flex-gap: calc(4px * 2); --wp-components-flex-justify: flex-start;"><span class="components-form-toggle is-checked"><input class="components-form-toggle__input" id="inspector-toggle-control-97" type="checkbox" checked=""><span class="components-form-toggle__track"></span><span class="components-form-toggle__thumb"></span></span><label data-wp-c16t="true" data-wp-component="FlexBlock" for="inspector-toggle-control-97" class="bc09d0edcc10c304__item c184ec8e81027f31__block components-flex-item components-flex-block components-toggle-control__label" style="--wp-components-flex-item-display: block;">Enhanced hover effect (cursor glow)</label></div></div></div><p class="components-base-control__help">A soft glow in the Hover text color above that follows the cursor, same size as the button glow effect. Set a Hover text color above for this to be visible — while this is on, that color only drives the glow and no longer recolors the whole text on hover.</p></div>",
